  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734238",
      "title": "Adding Route Protection",
      "sourceHash": "33b25ce7434f2bd37056ccfaa7bcf07efebaa41edc4c3c6d97c6347fcac4e909",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 3.023,
          "en": "Now, it's good",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.023,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "that we're conditionally updating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 7.68,
          "en": "the UI based on the existence of the token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.68,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "What we can still do though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 13.35,
          "en": "is we can manually go to events/new, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.35,
          "end": 14.91,
          "en": "so we can still reach that form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.91,
          "end": 17.037,
          "en": "even though we're not supposed to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.037,
          "end": 20.22,
          "en": "Of course, submitting the form would fail",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.22,
          "end": 24.06,
          "en": "because we actually wouldn't be able to attach a token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.06,
          "end": 25.437,
          "en": "to the outgoing request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.437,
          "end": 27.84,
          "en": "So we still have that protection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.84,
          "end": 29.07,
          "en": "but it would be even better",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 29.07,
          "end": 31.92,
          "en": "if we wouldn't be able to reach that form at all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.92,
          "end": 33.75,
          "en": "if we're not logged in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 33.75,
          "end": 36.3,
          "en": "So what we need is some route protection.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 39.66,
          "en": "Certain routes here should not always be accessible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.66,
          "end": 41.07,
          "en": "To be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 41.07,
          "end": 45.36,
          "en": "it's the added route here, and this new route here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 45.36,
          "end": 47.79,
          "en": "which should not always be accessible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 47.79,
          "end": 50.1,
          "en": "Because we shouldn't be able to reach these routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 50.1,
          "end": 51.36,
          "en": "if we're not logged in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.36,
          "end": 54.9,
          "en": "because we won't be able to use them correctly anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 54.9,
          "end": 58.44,
          "en": "So how can we add this kind of protection then?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 58.44,
          "end": 61.62,
          "en": "Well, we could utilize a loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.62,
          "end": 64.89,
          "en": "A loader that simply checks if we have a token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 64.89,
          "end": 68.61,
          "en": "And if we don't have a token, redirects us away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.61,
          "end": 72.51,
          "en": "And I'll add such a loader in this auth js helper file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.51,
          "end": 73.343,
          "en": "I'll add the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.84,
          "end": 77.55,
          "en": "checkAuthLoader here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.55,
          "end": 81.3,
          "en": "and in there I'll simply call getAuthToken",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.3,
          "end": 82.923,
          "en": "to see if I have a token.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.97,
          "end": 87,
          "en": "And if we don't have a token",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87,
          "end": 90.36,
          "en": "then I will return and call redirect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.36,
          "end": 94.53,
          "en": "from React-router-dom to generate a redirect response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.53,
          "end": 97.77000000000001,
          "en": "and redirect a way to /auth, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.77000000000001,
          "end": 100.053,
          "en": "so that the user is able to log in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.1,
          "end": 103.59,
          "en": "Alternatively, we could also throw an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.59,
          "end": 107.07,
          "en": "and show the error page that is totally up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.07,
          "end": 111.24000000000001,
          "en": "So now this loader here can be used to protect a route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.24000000000001,
          "end": 113.193,
          "en": "That's one way of protecting a route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.15,
          "end": 116.49000000000001,
          "en": "Now, back in app js, we can add that loader",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.49000000000001,
          "end": 118.77000000000001,
          "en": "to all the routes that need protection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.77000000000001,
          "end": 120.73,
          "en": "and that would be the checkAuthLoader",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.86,
          "end": 124.83,
          "en": "which the offer of course also must be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.83,
          "end": 129.289,
          "en": "from the util/auth file and that checkAuthLoader is added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 129.289,
          "end": 134.289,
          "en": "to the added route here and to the new event page route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.74099999999999,
          "end": 137.19,
          "en": "If we now save all files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.19,
          "end": 140.73,
          "en": "and I try to visit /events/new",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.73,
          "end": 142.68,
          "en": "whilst not being logged in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.68,
          "end": 145.38,
          "en": "you see I'm redirected to /auth.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.38,
          "end": 147.16,
          "en": "Of course, if I",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.47,
          "end": 151.44,
          "en": "do log in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.44,
          "end": 154.05,
          "en": "and I visit the new event route, I can go there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.05,
          "end": 157.56,
          "en": "Also, if I enter it manually, that all works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.56,
          "end": 160.56,
          "en": "But now we got proper protection in place to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.56,
          "end": 162.87,
          "en": "that we can't accidentally visit pages we're not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.87,
          "end": 164.103,
          "en": "supposed to visit.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}